Hushgrep v0.1.0-alpha.4

Original Rust scanner code, the GitHub Action, and the v10 fine-tuning
contributions are licensed under Apache-2.0.

The v10 checkpoint modifies Fastino GLiNER2.5 multi-v1 (Apache-2.0),
which uses Microsoft's mDeBERTa-v3-base (MIT). The Rust splitter and
span decoder adapt routines from Fastino GLiNER2 (Apache-2.0).
Fine-tuning used synthetic and labelled examples, including examples
derived from CredData. This distribution includes the inference checkpoint.

The Linux bundle includes ONNX Runtime 1.32.0 (MIT) and the unmodified
TruffleHog 3.99.9 executable (AGPL-3.0). Each component retains its
license. See the licenses directory in the bundle and the source links
in the release notes.
